<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S ANC UNDECIDED OVER BUYING SHIPS, SUBS.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S ANC UNDECIDED OVER BUYING SHIPS, SUBS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's ruling African National Congress said on Wednesday it had yet to decide if it supported plans to buy four navy corvettes and four submarines.</p>
<p>&quot;The ANC has not taken a decision on the acquisition of the corvettes and submarines,&quot; said Joseph Mashimbe, an ANC member of the parliamentary portfolio committee on defence.</p>
<p>He was responding during a meeting of the committee to remarks by members of the opposition National Party who said a final decision was needed on the transaction.</p>
<p>-Cape Town newsroom +2721 403-2502</p>
